{"id":"600417","name":"五彩蛋炒饭","author":"夏家妈妈的美食","authorId":"7306099","desc":"","cover":"images/600417/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"熟米饭","amount":"1碗"}],"sub":[{"name":"青豆","amount":"适量"},{"name":"火肥","amount":"半个"},{"name":"鸡旦","amount":"2个"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"4个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备火腿半根、青豆一小碗、鸡旦两个、香菇四个。","img":"images/600417/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"剩米饭一碗。","img":"images/600417/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将鸡旦炒好备用。","img":"images/600417/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中油热放入青豆、香菇炒七分熟。","img":"images/600417/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入米饭炒匀后，分别放入盐、生抽。","img":"images/600417/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再放入火腿丁、鸡旦。","img":"images/600417/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"最后放入少量的鸡精。","img":"images/600417/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"一盘色泽诱人的蛋炒饭好了。","img":"images/600417/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}